PMF/IGTK port experiment 2026-11-07 (branch wip-xr829-pmf, linux repo)
- keys.c AES_CMAC -> WSM_KEY_TYPE_IGTK_GROUP(8) + MIB 0x1020 policy, MMIE template in tx_h_crypt, deauth filter: builds, IGTK add ret=0.
- policy enable=0 + IGTK uploaded: WPA3 works, ping avg ~150 ms (no improvement).
